# Security

Before commit: no hardcoded secrets; validate input; parameterized queries; encode output; CSRF on cookie auth; authn/authz; rate limits on public endpoints; errors do not leak internals.

Secrets from env or a secret manager. Fail at startup if missing. Rotate anything exposed.

If a security issue is found: stop, fix CRITICAL, rotate, grep for the same pattern. Launch `security-review` only when the user asks.
